    "passage": "option to complete the dialogue.",
    "questionText": "Mr. Jackson:\n The price of the innocent mistakes allowed by our\ncurrent software-based security is simply too\nhigh.\nMrs. Swanson:\n ----\nMr. Jackson:\nExactly. That’s why our networked world needs\nbetter approaches to cybersecurity.\nMrs. Swanson:\nYeah. Just patching the software after a\ncyberattack, and hoping for the best is not good\nenough.",
