      "C": "While many corporations believe that fine-tuning hiring algorithms on more historical data may help solve the problem of algorithms mimicking human bias, it has become apparent that more discriminatory outcomes might be produced when larger data sets are used.",
      "D": "In order to handle the problem of algorithms mimicking human bias, many corporations have started to fine-tune hiring algorithms with more historical data, yet it has become clear that employing such large data sets can generate even more discriminatory outcomes.",
