      "B": "Leading climate scientists have called for governments to reduce greenhouse gas emissions by at least half in order to take urgent measures against the melting of polar ice caps.",
      "C": "What leading climate scientists have demanded from governments is to slow down the melting of polar ice caps by allowing time for urgent measures to be taken.",
      "D": "Governments have been called upon by leading climate scientists to slow down the melting of polar ice caps so that greenhouse gas emissions can be reduced by at least half.",
      "E": "Leading climate scientists have called for governments to take urgent measures in order to allow time for greenhouse gas emissions to be reduced by at least half, which can slow down the melting of polar ice caps."
