    "questionText": "Grace:\n– So, you've heard of digital burnout, right? It means someone is completely exhausted from constant screen exposure and notifications.\nLeo:\n– Oh, yeah, I've heard of that before. Actually, one of my colleagues is truly affected by it, and always seems drained after work. I think staying connected is good, but it should have its limits.\nGrace:\n– Definitely! And there's also decision fatigue from too many small choices during the day.\nLeo:\n– What's that? Is it even possible to get tired just from choosing?\nGrace:\n----\nLeo:\n– It's surprising to hear that it can affect people so severely.",
