    "questionText": "Marco:\n– I'm completely overwhelmed by boxes, old letters, and photographs in the attic. What should I do?\n\nElif:\n– I know exactly how that feels; clutter like that can take over an entire room. There's a method called 'the four-box rule' that might help.\n\nMarco:\n– What is that exactly? It sounds like some kind of game.\n\nElif:\n----\n\nMarco:\n– But what about things I'm not sure about? Items that don't clearly belong in any box.\n\nElif:\n– Set those aside in a separate pile and revisit them after a month; if you haven't thought about them by then, let them go.",
