    "questionText": "Yuki:\n– People complain about facial recognition cameras everywhere because they feel constantly monitored. But the more retailers learn about shoppers, the better they can personalise offers.\n\nBella:\n– What about insurance companies asking for access to our driving data? We agree to lengthy terms and conditions without fully grasping what we're consenting to.\n\nYuki:\n----\n\nBella:\n– What if that data is misused or sold to third parties without our knowledge? I've read about people being charged higher premiums unfairly.\n\nYuki:\n– Hmm, then this kind of data collection really could be a legitimate concern.",
