    "questionText": "Clownfish and sea anemones share one of the most well-known partnerships in the ocean. ---- The clownfish gains protection from predators by hiding among the anemone's stinging tentacles, to which it has developed immunity through a protective mucus layer. In return, the clownfish drives away fish that might otherwise nibble on the anemone, and its waste provides the anemone with valuable nutrients. Neither organism could easily achieve on its own what they accomplish together.\n\n(Boşluğa uygun cümleyi seçiniz.)",
