    "solutionMethod": "✅ Doğru cevap: B) in terms of\n\n🔎 Neden doğru? Cümle, mesleklerin cinsiyet açısından daha dengeli hâle geldiğini belirtir; bu nedenle 'in terms of' (açısından) doğru seçenektir.\n\n❌ Diğer seçenekler neden yanlış?\n\nA) in case of: koşul bildirir, uygun değildir.\n\nC) as a result of: sonuç bildirir, cümlenin anlamına uymaz.\n\nD) as opposed to: karşıtlık bildirir, uygun değildir.\n\nE) thanks to: sebep bildirir, cümlenin yapısına uymaz.\n\n🧠 YDS taktiği: Bir konunun hangi açıdan ele alındığını belirten cümlelerde 'in terms of' kalıbı aranmalıdır.\n\n📌 Öğrenilmesi gereken kelime/kalıp: in terms of: açısından, bakımından\n\n17-21: Paragraf Tamamlama Sorusu (Kelime/Bağlaç)\n\nParagraf Tamamlama Sorusu (Bağlaç)\n\nIt is difficult to estimate the number of Sami people in the world today because many members of this dispersed community do not register themselves as Sami. The details of the origins of the Sami are not known for certain, (17)---- they are generally considered to be among the oldest surviving cultures of northern Europe. It is likely that the Sami descended, perhaps thousands of years ago, from hunter-gatherer groups who moved north along the coastlines of Scandinavia as glaciers retreated. The Sami (18)---- numerous attempts at assimilation throughout their history. (19)---- repeated policies designed to suppress their language and customs, their culture is still vibrant today. The Sami population is distributed (20)---- the countries of Norway, Sweden, Finland, and Russia. Generally speaking, it is likely that most reindeer-herding communities in the Scandinavian Arctic are of Sami origin. Although precise statistics are (21)---- now, experts estimate that around half of all Sami live in Norway, with the remainder found in Sweden, Finland, and Russia.",
