    "questionText": "Mark:\n– Even though I meticulously track every calorie and macronutrient using the apps recommended by nutritionists, I still struggle to build any noticeable muscle.\n\nLaura:\n– There isn't much solid evidence behind some of these tracking apps, and recent studies have questioned the accuracy of many of them.\n\nMark:\n– Why on earth do people keep recommending them, then?\n\nLaura:\n– ----\nMark:\n– I suppose that makes sense; everyone's body seems to respond so differently.",
