    "questionText": "Nora:\n– Did you know that eating fermented foods could actually help strengthen your immune system?\n\nLeo:\n– ----\n\nNora:\n– An imbalanced gut microbiome can weaken your body's natural defences, making you more susceptible to infections. And fermented foods are rich in probiotics, which may help restore a healthy balance of gut bacteria.\nLeo:\n– Then, I will try to include more of them in my meals for a healthier immune system.",
