    "solutionMethod": "✅ Doğru cevap: A) as well as\n\n🔎 Neden doğru? İki olumlu özelliği birlikte sıralayan 'as well as' (-in yanı sıra) kalıbı doğru seçenektir.\n\n❌ Diğer seçenekler neden yanlış?\n\nB) prior to: -den önce, anlam uyuşmuyor\n\nC) in terms of: açısından, anlam uyuşmuyor\n\nD) on behalf of: adına, anlam uyuşmuyor\n\nE) as a result of: sonucunda, anlam uyuşmuyor\n\n🧠 YDS taktiği: İki olumlu özelliği birlikte sıralayan cümlelerde 'as well as' kalıbı aranmalıdır.\n\n📌 Öğrenilmesi gereken kelime/kalıp: as well as: -in yanı sıra, ile birlikte\n\n17-21: Paragraf Tamamlama Sorusu (Edat/Kip)\n\nParagraf Tamamlama Sorusu (Edat)\n\nVenus is the most inhospitable of the rocky planets. (17)---- extreme surface temperatures, the planet has been explored by just a handful of missions to date: Venera in the 1970s and the more recent Akatsuki spacecraft, which studied Venus from orbit. Spacecraft (18)---- extremely resilient to survive the descent through its atmosphere. When they approach the surface, they must withstand crushing pressure just as the thick clouds are blocking most of the sunlight. In addition, the density of the atmosphere near Venus is so extreme that landers survive only briefly, and (19)---- to the surface makes it hard for spacecraft to transmit data for long. (20)----, Venera and Akatsuki have reached the planet successfully and studied its features and properties. A future mission, the joint NASA–ESA EnVision, may reveal more (21)---- this scorching planet.",
