    "questionText": "Claire:\n I'm reading an article about sustainability and wondering what 'carbon footprint' actually means.\n\nDaniel:\n It's a measure of the total greenhouse gases produced, directly or indirectly, by a person's activities.\n\nClaire:\n ----\n\nDaniel:\n Basically, it accounts for things like transportation, energy use, and diet, so in general it reflects your overall environmental impact.\n\nClaire:\n The article also claims it's possible to compare footprints between individuals living in urban areas and those in rural areas.",
