    "questionText": "Oliver:\n Yesterday I read about the effects of excessive screen time, and as you're always on your phone, I thought I needed to share this with you.\n\nGrace:\n Actually everyone knows about some of the harmful effects of too much screen time, but I'm curious about what you'll say.\n\nOliver:\n As I've learned, excessive screen exposure can disrupt sleep patterns, strain the eyes, and reduce attention span.\n\nGrace:\n ----\n\nOliver:\n Actually, the article I read mentioned setting specific screen-free hours, especially before bedtime. If you really need your phone, then dim the brightness and reduce notifications.",
