      "B": "However, the unrealistic workloads we normalise unconsciously lead to exhaustion, which has powerful effects on morale, output, and retention of both junior and senior staff.",
      "C": "In brief, we know that flexible schedules can improve satisfaction and even performance of employees who are already thriving in their careers.",
      "D": "Still, workplace diversity should be a critical element for designing a desired working environment to allow all employees to do their best.",
