    "questionText": "Olivia:\n Preparing a minimalist backpack for a weekend hike is a nice idea in theory. But somehow it's easy to overpack anyway. You think you must bring this gadget in order to use that one and you end up needing everything else to support it.\n\nMarcus:\n That's unnecessary. What the body actually needs is simple. It needs water more than anything else. In fact, you can go without food for several days if you have to.\n\nOlivia:\n ----\n\nMarcus:\n Almost anything tastes wonderful out there because you'll be famished, and besides, you're in the middle of nature!",
