    "questionText": "Leo:\n On my geography course, we're learning about capital cities of the Nordic countries. Can you name any of these cities?\n\nNina:\n The one I'm thinking of is Reykjavik, the capital of Iceland. Where did the name 'Reykjavik' come from, by the way?\n\nLeo:\n ----\n\nNina:\n Wow! I didn't know that. So the history of the name 'Reykjavik' is much simpler than I had expected it would be.",
