    "questionText": "Ben:\n We'll need to be careful about not getting Lyme disease on our Scandinavian hiking trip.\n\nMia:\n What's Lyme disease? I've never heard of that.\n\nBen:\n It's a bacterial infection spread by ticks.\n\nMia:\n Well, that's definitely not something I want to get. How about we just stick to open trails so we avoid tick-infested underbrush?\n\nBen:\n ----\n\nMia:\n Then let's read up on how to prevent tick bites to avoid getting bitten in the first place.",
