      "C": "Indeed, rumour-spreading is concerning because of its potential to unduly influence attitudes and behaviour.",
      "D": "From an ethical perspective, many people worry most about the active promotion of rumours.",
      "E": "However, media systems do not censor many types of it before being put in content made available to audiences."
