    "questionText": "Marco:\n The scale of wildfire destruction around the world shows that something must be done immediately. Just think about the fires in Canada in 2023.\n\nSofia:\n ----\n\nMarco:\n Neither. Actually, a more comprehensive approach would be better.\n\nSofia:\n Well, I completely agree that urgent measures are needed.",
