    "questionText": "Student:\n I think for my final presentation I'm going to focus on identity and the characteristics of well-travelled people.\n\nTeacher:\n ----\n\nStudent:\n Well I like the topic because how people interpret it may vary greatly. To some, being well-travelled means visiting many countries while for others it only refers to adapting to different cultures.\n\nTeacher:\n I see your point now. Then, you will also need to address how complementary these two views are to each other.",
