    "questionText": "Immunologists know a great deal about how individual antibodies function but remarkably little about how large numbers of them coordinate to produce a full immune response.",
    "options": {
      "A": "Immunologists' comprehensive understanding of the workings of individual antibodies may contribute significantly to what they know about large numbers of antibodies, which are thought to coordinate to produce a full immune response.",
      "B": "As they already know how antibodies behave individually, what immunologists need to focus more on is how large antibody groups coordinate to produce a full immune response.",
      "C": "Immunologists are knowledgeable enough about how individual antibodies function during the production of a full immune response, but they know little about how large numbers of antibodies perform these duties.",
      "D": "Immunologists' knowledge of how large numbers of antibodies coordinate for the production of a full immune response is rather limited despite the fact that they have vast knowledge of how individual antibodies work.",
      "E": "Immunologists have already discovered enough about the functioning of individual antibodies, and now they need to expand their knowledge of how large antibody groups produce a full immune response."
    },
    "correctAnswer": "D",
    "solutionMethod": "✅ Doğru cevap: D) Immunologists' knowledge of how large numbers of antibodies coordinate for the production of a full immune response is rather limited despite the fact that they have vast knowledge of how individual antibodies work.\n\n🔎 Neden doğru? Doğru seçenek, kaynak cümledeki 'know a great deal about X but remarkably little about Y' karşıtlığını 'despite the fact that... vast knowledge... rather limited' yapısıyla doğru şekilde ve aynı anlamda aktarır.\n\n❌ Diğer seçenekler neden yanlış?\n\nA) kaynaktaki 'ama çok az biliyorlar' zıtlığı kayboluyor, tek yönlü bir katkı ilişkisi kuruluyor\n\nB) kaynaktaki bilgi durumu bir öneriye/gerekliliğe dönüştürülmüş, kaynakta böyle bir tavsiye yoktur\n\nC) 'during the production of a full immune response' ifadesi, bireysel antikorların işlevini yanlış bir bağlama oturtuyor\n\nE) kaynaktaki bilgi durumu yine bir öneriye/gerekliliğe dönüştürülmüş, kaynakta böyle bir tavsiye yoktur\n\n🧠 YDS taktiği: 'know a lot about X but little about Y' yapılı cümlelerde, yeniden ifadenin bu karşıtlığı bir öneri veya tavsiyeye dönüştürmediğinden emin olun; sadece mevcut bilgi durumunu yansıtmalıdır.\n\n📌 Öğrenilmesi gereken kelime/kalıp: despite the fact that + cümle, ...: ...gerçeğine rağmen\n\n72-75: Paragraf Tamamlama Sorusu (Anlam Bütünlüğü)\n\nParagraf Tamamlama Sorusu (Anlam Bütünlüğü)",
