    "questionText": "Rob: How lucky that they've found over 80 fossilised dinosaur footprints that have survived for over 100 million years in England!\n\nSherry: ----\n\nRob: Well, the animal has to step in sediment that's pliable enough to record its footprint, but not so pliable that it washes away before being covered by another layer of fresh sediment.\n\nSherry: Is that so? Seems like a lot of luck is involved then.",
