    "questionText": "Daisy: Look at that lighthouse up on the hill. Do you think anyone lives there?\n\nKate: ----\n\nDaisy: Maybe that big antenna on the roof explains it.\n\nKate: So the keeper only goes up there for routine maintenance.",
