    "questionText": "Chris: A team of engineers tried to build drones that could fly through hoops used in drone racing, and set up a circuit with several gates.\n\nLuke: Really? Could the drones stay on course?\n\nChris: ----\n\nLuke: That's an important step forward. A drone that can dodge obstacles on its own could be useful in many settings.",
