    "questionText": "(I) The plant kingdom is vast and varied, yielding countless herbal remedies that people have relied on for thousands of years. (II) A qualified herbalist or a well-regarded specialist is generally the person people consult for the most effective herbal treatments. (III) Today, modern scientific research continues to confirm and document the traditional uses of many herbs, along with new applications for some traditional remedies. (IV) The careful, responsible use of traditional herbal medicine offers a meaningful way to cut healthcare costs and improve public wellness. (V) It seems likely that further scientific research will keep placing herbs in a position to offer real benefits within 21st-century medicine.",
